  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 808.06 Reclamation Activities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 808.06 Reclamation Activities.\n\n(a) Reclamation activities shall be approved as construction activities by the department in accordance with Env-Sw 1104.\n\n(b) Reclamation activities shall be conducted by the permittee in accordance with the construction requirements of Env-Sw 1104.\n\nSource. #14156, eff 12-21-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-sw800.html"
